{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 7,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 347.483,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I would that ye might know that after my father, Lehi, had made an end of prophesying concerning his seed,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.192,
      "end": 13.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it came to pass that the Lord spake unto him again, saying that it was not meet for him, Lehi,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 14.152,
      "end": 18.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should take his family into the wilderness alone;",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 18.279,
      "end": 21.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that his sons should take daughters to wife,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 21.385,
      "end": 25.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might raise up seed unto the Lord in the land of promise.",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 25.734,
      "end": 36.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord commanded him that I, Nephi, and my brethren, should again return unto the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 36.456,
      "end": 39.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bring down Ishmael and his family into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 40.433,
      "end": 44.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Nephi, did again, with my brethren,",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 45.164,
      "end": 48.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "go forth into the wilderness to go up to Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 48.955,
      "end": 52.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we went up unto the house of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 52.757,
      "end": 55.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we did gain favor in the sight of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 55.77,
      "end": 59.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that we did speak unto him the words of the Lord.",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 60.212,
      "end": 64.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord did soften the heart of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 64.479,
      "end": 66.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also his household,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 66.331,
      "end": 71.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that they took their journey with us down into the wilderness",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 71.294,
      "end": 72.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the tent of our father.",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 73.646,
      "end": 77.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that as we journeyed in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 77.216,
      "end": 79.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold Laman and Lemuel,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.393,
      "end": 81.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and two of the daughters of Ishmael",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 81.756,
      "end": 85.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the two sons of Ishmael and their families, did rebel against us;",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 86.116,
      "end": 88.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, against me, Nephi, and Sam,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 89.082,
      "end": 92.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their father, Ishmael, and his wife,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 92.234,
      "end": 94.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his three other daughters.",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 94.772,
      "end": 97.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the which rebellion,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 97.46,
      "end": 100.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were desirous to return unto the land of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 101.484,
      "end": 105.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, being grieved for the hardness of their hearts,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 105.611,
      "end": 108.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I spake unto them, saying,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 108.392,
      "end": 111.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even unto Laman and unto Lemuel:",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 111.219,
      "end": 113.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold ye are mine elder brethren,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 113.582,
      "end": 118.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and how is it that ye are so hard in your hearts, and so blind in your minds,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 118.685,
      "end": 121.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye have need that I, your younger brother,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 121.744,
      "end": 123.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should speak unto you,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 123.503,
      "end": 125.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and set an example for you?",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 126.412,
      "end": 129.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How is it that ye have not hearkened unto the word of the Lord?",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 130.668,
      "end": 132.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How is it that ye have forgotten",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 132.798,
      "end": 135.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye have seen an angel of the Lord?",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 135.707,
      "end": 138.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and how is it that ye have forgotten",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 138.348,
      "end": 144.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what great things the Lord hath done for us, in delivering us out of the hands of Laban,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 144.658,
      "end": 147.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that we should obtain the record?",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 147.706,
      "end": 150.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and how is it that ye have forgotten",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 150.347,
      "end": 155.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord is able to do all things according to his will, for the children of men,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 155.728,
      "end": 158.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it so be that they exercise faith in him?",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 158.787,
      "end": 161.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, let us be faithful to him.",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 161.835,
      "end": 164.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if it so be that we are faithful to him,",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 164.709,
      "end": 167.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we shall obtain the land of promise;",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 167.304,
      "end": 170.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall know at some future period",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 170.363,
      "end": 173.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the word of the Lord shall be fulfilled",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 173.19,
      "end": 175.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the destruction of Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 175.971,
      "end": 183.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for all things which the Lord hath spoken concerning the destruction of Jerusalem must be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 183.803,
      "end": 188.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the Spirit of the Lord ceaseth soon to strive with them;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 188.766,
      "end": 191.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, they have rejected the prophets,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 191.593,
      "end": 193.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Jeremiah have they cast into prison.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 194.095,
      "end": 200.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they have sought to take away the life of my father, insomuch that they have driven him out of the land.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 200.859,
      "end": 202.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 202.989,
      "end": 205.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye will return unto Jerusalem",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 205.491,
      "end": 207.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall also perish with them.",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 207.761,
      "end": 210.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, if ye have choice, go up to the land,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 211.099,
      "end": 214.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remember the words which I speak unto you",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 214.205,
      "end": 216.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye go ye will also perish;",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 216.753,
      "end": 220.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus the Spirit of the Lord constraineth me that I should speak.",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 221.427,
      "end": 225.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when I, Nephi, had spoken these words unto my brethren,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 226.065,
      "end": 227.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were angry with me.",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 227.685,
      "end": 231.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did lay their hands upon me,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 231.441,
      "end": 234.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, they were exceedingly wroth,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 234.268,
      "end": 236.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did bind me with cords,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 236.398,
      "end": 238.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they sought to take away my life,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 239.179,
      "end": 242.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might leave me in the wilderness",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 242.47,
      "end": 244.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be devoured by wild beasts.",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 245.333,
      "end": 248.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass that I prayed unto the Lord, saying:",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 248.671,
      "end": 251.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord, according to my faith which is in thee,",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 251.916,
      "end": 255.492,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou deliver me from the hands of my brethren;",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 255.672,
      "end": 257.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even give me strength",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 257.57,
      "end": 260.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may burst these bands with which I am bound.",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 261.501,
      "end": 264.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when I had said these words,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 264.839,
      "end": 268.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the bands were loosed from off my hands and feet,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 268.316,
      "end": 270.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I stood before my brethren,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 270.493,
      "end": 272.304,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I spake unto them again.",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 272.984,
      "end": 276.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they were angry with me again,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 276.275,
      "end": 278.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sought to lay hands upon me;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 278.684,
      "end": 281.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, one of the daughters of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 281.697,
      "end": 283.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also her mother,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 283.642,
      "end": 285.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and one of the sons of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 285.819,
      "end": 290.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did plead with my brethren, insomuch that they did soften their hearts;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 290.875,
      "end": 293.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did cease striving to take away my life.",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 294.434,
      "end": 301.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they were sorrowful, because of their wickedness, insomuch that they did bow down before me,",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 301.766,
      "end": 303.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did plead with me",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 303.618,
      "end": 307.798,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I would forgive them of the thing that they had done against me.",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 308.478,
      "end": 313.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I did frankly forgive them all that they had done,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 313.581,
      "end": 315.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I did exhort them",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 315.34,
      "end": 318.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would pray unto the Lord their God for forgiveness.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 318.678,
      "end": 321.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did so.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 321.366,
      "end": 324.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they had done praying unto the Lord",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 324.286,
      "end": 328.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we did again travel on our journey towards the tent of our father.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 329.238,
      "end": 333.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did come down unto the tent of our father.",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 333.412,
      "end": 337.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after I and my brethren and all the house of Ishmael",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 337.354,
      "end": 339.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had come down unto the tent of my father,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 340.135,
      "end": 343.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did give thanks unto the Lord their God;",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 343.194,
      "end": 346.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did offer sacrifice and burnt offerings unto him.",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 102
    }
  ]
}